// Module-local workspace so `cd src/build && go test -tags unit_test ./...`
// works: the repo-root go.work deliberately contains only src/internal
// (Dagger modules are isolated — see the root go.work comment), which would
// otherwise make Go refuse to run tests from this directory. `use .` scopes
// the workspace to this module alone.
